# Voice Menu Project - Technical Handoff Rules

## 1. Stack & Structure
- **Language**: Vanilla JS (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3 (Tailwind via CDN)
- **Runtime**: Cloudflare Pages + Workers (Pages Functions API)
- **Storage**: Cloudflare KV (config), R2 (images)
- **Deploy**: `wrangler pages dev` (dev), `wrangler pages deploy` (prod)

**Key Files:**
- `index.html` - Main SPA entry, SSR-rendered via config
- `pad.html` - Admin panel (SPA, protected by Basic Auth)
- `config.json` - Source of truth (sections, images, prices, nav)
- `assets/js/app.js` - Client SPA: nav, scroll, modals, i18n, price rendering
- `assets/js/admin.js` - Admin SPA: CRUD images, price editor (drag/draw/resize/text)
- `assets/css/styles.css` - All styles (Tailwind + custom)
- `functions/api/admin/config.js` - GET/PUT config (KV)
- `functions/api/admin/upload.js` - POST image → R2, returns public URL
- `functions/api/admin/images/[id].js` - DELETE image from R2
- `functions/api/images/[[path]].js` - Serves R2 images via Worker (bypasses SPA fallback)

## 2. Architecture & Data

### Config Structure (`config.json`)
```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "navigation": { "horizontal": [], "vertical": [] },
  "sections": [
    { "id": "food-section", "titleKey": "sections.food", "images": [{ "id", "src", "alt", "prices": [], "priceZones": [] }] }
  ]
}
```
- **Sections**: `food-section`, `drinks-section`, `promo-modal`, `birthday-modal`
- **Images**: Each has `id`, `src` (R2 URL), `alt`, `prices[]` (legacy), `priceZones[]` (new)
- **Price Zone**: `{ id, x_percent, y_percent, w_percent, h_percent, text, fontSize, color, textShadow }`

### Price Editor (Admin)
- **Two Modes**: `place` (draw rectangles) / `price` (edit text/style)
- **Coordinates**: Stored as **percentages** of the image area: `x_percent`, `y_percent`, `w_percent`, `h_percent` (0-100, 1 decimal)
- **Wrapper**: `#price-editor-wrapper` is sized in px by `sizePriceEditorWrapper()` to match the image fitting box exactly (aspect preserved, height capped at 70vh) → overlay `inset:0` == image area
- **Rendering**: `renderZoneOverlay()` applies coordinates directly as CSS percentages — **no % → px conversion**
- **Drawing/Drag/Resize**: single source of truth = `overlay.getBoundingClientRect()` (== image area); `%` computed as `px / rect.width|height * 100` on mouseup
- **Admin Save**: Serializes zones → saves to `image.priceZones` + syncs legacy `prices[]`

### Client Price Rendering (`app.js:renderPriceTags`)
1. Finds `.price-overlay[data-image-id]` (sibling of the `<img>` inside `.image-wrapper`)
2. `.image-wrapper` (position:relative, container-type:inline-size) hugs the image: `.image-wrapper > img` is `display:block; width:100%; height:auto` (declared in CSS, not only Tailwind), so the `inset:0` overlay == image area exactly
3. A zone is a RECTANGLE (x_percent/y_percent = top-left, w/h = size), exactly as the admin draws it. The tag OCCUPIES that rectangle 1:1: inline `left/top/width/height` in `%`, `box-sizing:border-box`, `overflow:hidden`, `display:flex; align-items/justify-content:center; line-height:1`. NO padding/border/radius/shadow (`padding:0; border:none; border-radius:0; box-shadow:none`). Background = `zone.backgroundColor` (falls back to the admin mask background `rgba(0,0,0,0.2)`) so it covers the printed price only inside the box. Legacy `prices[]` (no w/h) → centered point label (`transform: translate(-50%,-50%)`)
4. Font size is fluid via Container Queries. The stored pixel size is converted to `cqw` by `fontSizeToCqw(px) = px / 5.6` (baseline: 14px == 2.5cqw @560px) and rendered as `clamp(8px, Xcqw, 96px)`. The admin uses the identical formula → what the admin sees == the client

### Admin Price Editor — key behaviors
- `.js-price-font-size` / `.js-price-color` / `.js-price-shadow` controls exist in BOTH toolbar and sidebar → bound by CLASS via `querySelectorAll` (never by id; a duplicate `id="price-font-size"` used to wire only the hidden toolbar select)
- PLACE mode hides ALL style settings: `setPriceEditorModeUI()` sets `display:none` inline on `#price-sidebar` and `#price-toolbar` (inline is required because the sidebar's `lg:block` utility overrides `hidden` at ≥1024px). PRICE mode clears the inline override
- Zone delete (×) button: `pointerdown` + `click` with `stopPropagation()/preventDefault()`; `onMouseDown` ignores events originating on `.btn-delete-zone-on-overlay`; CSS forces `pointer-events:auto; z-index:30`. Prevents the zone drag from engaging and the overlay re-render from swallowing the click
- `#price-editor-wrapper` has `container-type:inline-size`, so zone text `cqw` is relative to the image width (same as the client)

## 3. Working Features (DO NOT BREAK)
- ✅ Config-driven rendering (nav, sections, modals, prices)
- ✅ i18n (RO/RU/EN) via `i18n.js` + `data-i18n` attributes
- ✅ Horizontal/Vertical nav + smooth scroll + header show/hide on scroll
- ✅ Promo/Birthday modals (open/close/back/esc/backdrop)
- ✅ Language switcher (RO/RU/EN) with localStorage
- ✅ Image lazy loading + lazy-loaded price overlays
- ✅ Admin: CRUD images (upload to R2, delete from R2, reorder via SortableJS)
- ✅ Price Editor: Draw rectangles (PLACE), edit text/style (PRICE)
- ✅ Drag/resize zones in PLACE mode (constrained to image display area)
- ✅ Click zone → edit text inline (PRICE mode)
- ✅ Font size dropdown, color picker, text-shadow toggle (sidebar)
- ✅ Drag/resize zones in PLACE mode (constrained to image display rect)
- ✅ Save → KV + sync to legacy `prices[]` + R2 image URLs
- ✅ Responsive: mobile-first, Tailwind + custom CSS
- ✅ i18n (RO/RU/EN) with localStorage persistence

## 4. Coordinate System (RESOLVED — simplified, no letterbox math)

### Approach: container parity + direct CSS percentages
**Files**: `app.js` (client), `admin.js` (admin), `styles.css`

1. **Client** — `.image-wrapper` wraps `<img class="w-full h-auto">` (no `object-fit`), so the wrapper's box == the image's box. The overlay `inset: 0` exactly covers the image. Zones use plain CSS percentages: `left: ${x_percent}%; top: ${y_percent}%`.
2. **Admin** — image sits inside `#price-editor-wrapper`, sized in px by `sizePriceEditorWrapper()` to the image fitting box exactly (aspect preserved, height capped at 70vh). Overlay `inset: 0` == image area → zones use plain CSS percentages.
3. **Single source of truth** for draw/drag/resize = `overlay.getBoundingClientRect()` (== image area). No `%`→px conversion at render.

**Key Functions**:
- `app.js` `renderPriceTags()` — direct CSS % positioning
- `admin.js` `sizePriceEditorWrapper()` — sizes wrapper to match image box
- `admin.js` `renderZoneOverlay()` — direct CSS % rendering
- `admin.js` `bindPriceEditorEvents()` → `getDrawRect()` — returns overlay viewport rect
- `admin.js` `makeZonesDraggableAndResizable()` — px ↔ % on mouseup
- `admin.js` `getImageDisplayRect()` — kept for compatibility, now returns overlay rect

### Previously reported issues — all fixed
1. ✅ Admin PLACE mode offset (old `getDrawRect()` read a non-existent `imageOffsetX` → NaN; now uses overlay rect)
2. ✅ Admin PRICE mode zone positions
3. ✅ Resize: no `%`→px math, no `_renderFunctions` map; CSS % keeps alignment
4. ✅ `price.price` vs `text` handled in `renderPriceTags()` fallback
5. ✅ Fluid font size via Container Queries (`clamp(10px, 2.5cqw, 26px)`)

### Responsive Font Size
- `.image-wrapper { container-type: inline-size }` + `.price-tag { font-size: clamp(10px, 2.5cqw, 26px) }`
- Admin zone text uses per-zone `fontSize` (px) from the sidebar

### Legacy / KV compatibility
- `savePrices()` writes `image.priceZones` and syncs `image.prices[]` (`{ id, price, x_percent, y_percent }`) — unchanged
- `renderAllPriceTags()` prefers `priceZones`, falls back to `prices[]`

### Acceptance Criteria
- [x] Zones drawn in admin appear exactly where cursor is
- [x] Zones render at identical positions in admin PLACE/PRICE modes and client
- [x] Window resize → zones stay fixed relative to image content (CSS %)
- [x] Font size scales with container width (cqw/clamp)
- [x] No coordinate drift on window resize / orientation change